{"3475130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Immortal Boy", "steam_appid": 3475130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/a7071a9d803144990f643dae6a2f5621.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=708 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/a7071a9d803144990f643dae6a2f5621.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/ea7ebf030becd1b391319f087e265582.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/ea7ebf030becd1b391319f087e265582.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/ea7ebf030becd1b391319f087e265582.mp4?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/58658f076f0c5a3912d32a42c34a5a4c.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/58658f076f0c5a3912d32a42c34a5a4c.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/58658f076f0c5a3912d32a42c34a5a4c.mp4?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/0eab63c1b0852433b59d239d11d17ea0.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=708 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/0eab63c1b0852433b59d239d11d17ea0.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Immortal Boy</i> is a <i>2.5D Turn-Based RPG</i> where you fight your enemies through a series of <strong>3D Bullet-Hell minigames!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through <strong>vibrant retro-fantasy worlds, solve intricate puzzles, and dodge your way through whacky foes and their whacky attacks </strong>whilst completing your enemy's games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎲 3D Bullet-Hell Minigame Combat System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Turn-Based and Party-Based RPG Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔓 Unlock unusual Special Abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📕 Complete a multitude of cute Side Quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪟 Nostalgic Old Windows Aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 Revel in a story that flips all classic RPG tropes; no <i>'Chosen One'</i>, no <i>'Prophecies'</i>, no <i>'Saving the World'</i>; just 4 friends travelling across continents get a Wishing Star - as they fight off the entire world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/43dd96a557a2c1828839808e0e53841b.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=708 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/43dd96a557a2c1828839808e0e53841b.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enemy Turn Minigame combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>3D Minigames!</i> Dodge enemy attacks in a 3rd-Person Bullet-Hell and complete the objectives, whether that'd be:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge projectiles 🏃</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spell out a word 🔤</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook a Hamburger 🍔</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your enemy in a game of Poker ♦️</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more! 👀</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Player Turn Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health is Currency! In this Turn-Based System, Special Abilities are used at the cost of a Character's Health, such as:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splash damage to enemies 💥</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revive dead teammates 🧬</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gambling for your health 🎰</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among others... 👀</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/008b7f23ff0b56d82fd38d8abcb87f7a.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/008b7f23ff0b56d82fd38d8abcb87f7a.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/008b7f23ff0b56d82fd38d8abcb87f7a.mp4?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/d19b5625e03d0a8edcd485b217de2d70.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/d19b5625e03d0a8edcd485b217de2d70.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/d19b5625e03d0a8edcd485b217de2d70.mp4?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Puzzles and Minigames</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a multitude of fun <strong>minigames</strong> and solve <strong>cute little puzzles</strong> that reveal new paths, items, and story elements! Such minigames and puzzles include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden puzzle trails 🧩</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Board Games! 🎲</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simon Says??? 🗣️</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lots more! 👀</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/c2a5c0159ea04c90fcf2038ee1272b53.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/c2a5c0159ea04c90fcf2038ee1272b53.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/c2a5c0159ea04c90fcf2038ee1272b53.mp4?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/791e6321c853616e3a814932eb8af921.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/791e6321c853616e3a814932eb8af921.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/791e6321c853616e3a814932eb8af921.mp4?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/bd644243d06bab02866829a5d020ca0d.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/bd644243d06bab02866829a5d020ca0d.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/bd644243d06bab02866829a5d020ca0d.mp4?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration and Extremely Interactive World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover unique environments like snow kingdoms, casino cities, sci-fi utopias and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something as simple as a wall can have some piece of dialogue or interactive gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The base game's content includes:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 chapters worth of content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >~10 hours worth of gameplay (base playthrough)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of side quests</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/9b7c1833e316c03e53268329f73c1260.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=900 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/9b7c1833e316c03e53268329f73c1260.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/9b7c1833e316c03e53268329f73c1260.mp4?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/a7071a9d803144990f643dae6a2f5621.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=708 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/a7071a9d803144990f643dae6a2f5621.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/ea7ebf030becd1b391319f087e265582.poster.avif?t=1788266708\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/ea7ebf030becd1b391319f087e265582.webm?t=1788266708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3475130/extras/ea7ebf030becd1b391319f087e265582.mp4?t=17882